<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-INVESTMENT BANK 6-MO PROFIT RISES 2-TIMES.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-INVESTMENT BANK 6-MO PROFIT RISES 2-TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian Investment Bank, a state institution that funnels credits to small and medium-sized business, said on Friday that its first-half profit was 143,139 lats, some 20 times higher than in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that its credit portfolio rose from around five million lats to 12 million lats while its assets were up to 18.11 million lats, around 1.5 times higher than at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>The EBRD and Swedfund are also major shareholders in the bank.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
